{
  "id": 21,
  "name": "regret_return_balanced_v1",
  "intent": "Increase regret coefficient from (0.25 - 0.15*p) to (0.40 - 0.25*p) to better handle uniform instances where local distance has low discriminative power and strong lookahead reduces structurally poor insertions. Keep return-aware weighting identical to parent (0.15 + 0.40*p) to preserve strong grid performance and late-stage tour closure behavior.",
